<title>USA: Guaranty National Q2 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Guaranty National Q2 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colorado 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guaranty National Corporation</p>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					     Six Months  Three Months</p>
<p>						 Ended	   Ended</p>
<p>						June 30,     June 30,</p>
<p>					1997     1996     1997     1996</p>
<p>Revenue:</p>
<p>   Premiums earned	  $263,272 $234,419 $134,597 $118,949</p>
<p>   Net investment income    21,608   18,519   10,863    9,266</p>
<p>Realized investment gains</p>
<p>				     4,955    3,589    3,543    1,608</p>
<p>				   289,835  256,527  149,003  129,823</p>
<p>Expenses:</p>
<p>Losses and loss adjustment</p>
<p>     expenses incurred     183,126  168,507   94,264   83,662</p>
<p>Policy acquisition costs</p>
<p>				    69,336   60,560   33,366   31,478</p>
<p>General and administrative</p>
<p>				     6,527    6,925    3,947    3,397</p>
<p>   Interest			3,307    3,403    1,654    1,683</p>
<p>   Other			     689	783	342	495</p>
<p>Nonrecurring tender offer charge</p>
<p>					  --    2,163	 --    2,163</p>
<p>				   262,985  242,341  133,573  122,878</p>
<p>Earnings before income taxes</p>
<p>				    26,850   14,186   15,430    6,945</p>
<p> Income taxes		    7,390    3,174    4,388    1,720</p>
<p> Net earnings		   19,460   11,012   11,042    5,225</p>
<p> Earnings per common share    1.29     0.74     0.73     0.35</p>
<p> Dividends per common share   0.25     0.25    0.125    0.125</p>
<p>NOTE: In the second quarter of 1996 the company reported operating earnings of $6.0 million, or $0.40 per share, before realised capital gains and a nonrecurring tender offer charge.</p>
<p>The nonrecurring charge of $1.8 million, or $0.12 per share, net of income taxes, was due to expenses associated with Orion Capital Corporation's successful tender offer, which resulted in an increase in Orion's ownership of Guaranty National to slightly more than 80 percent.</p>
<p>Net earnings for the second quarter of 1996, including realised capital gains and the nonrecurring charge, totalled $5.2 million, or $0.35 per share.</p>
<p>For the first six months of 1996, operating earnings were $10.5 million, or $0.70 per share. Realised capital gains, net of income taxes, were $2.3 million, or $0.16 cents per share.</p>
<p>Net earnings, including realised capital gains and the nonrecurring charge, were $11.0 million, or $0.74 cents per share.</p>
